    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. But isn't there a serious argument that without strong border enforcement and a secure perimeter, a pathway to citizenship just creates a \"pull factor\" that encourages more illegal crossings and undermines the rule of law? Doesn't that create more social instability in the long run?",
